    description: "The AI-Based Career Prediction System is a Machine Learning-based web application that helps students identify suitable career paths based on their academic performance, skills, and interests. The system collects inputs such as academic marks, mathematics score, logical thinking ability, communication skills, Python programming skills, and interest in AI and business. A Decision Tree Classifier trained using Scikit-learn analyzes these inputs and predicts the most appropriate career option.\n\nThe application is built using Python Flask for the backend, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript for the frontend, and Pandas for data processing. The trained model is saved using Joblib and integrated with the Flask application to provide real-time predictions. The project features a modern, responsive user interface and is deployed online using Vercel, with source code managed through GitHub. The system aims to guide students in making informed career decisions using Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning.\\n\\n**Status**: The project is currently in the working prototype stage. The Machine Learning model has been developed using a Decision Tree Classifier and integrated with a Flask backend. The frontend provides a responsive user interface for entering student details and viewing career predictions. Core features such as data processing, model prediction, and user interaction have been implemented. The project has been deployed on Vercel for online access. Future improvements include adding more career options, improving prediction accuracy with larger datasets, implementing user authentication, and providing personalized career guidance and learning recommendations.\\n\\n**Repository**: [GitHub Link](https://github.com/thepranavugale/career-predictor)",
